---
title: Styled Flowchart
---
flowchart LR
  classDef hot fill:#f96,stroke:#9a3412,stroke-width:3px
  classDef cold fill:#1e3a8a,stroke:#93c5fd,color:#fff
  classDef database stroke:#a21caf,stroke-dasharray:4 3

  web[Web App]:::cold --> api[Orders API]:::hot
  api --> db[(Orders DB)]:::database
  api -.-> queue{{Events}}
  queue --> worker[Worker]
  worker --> db
  api --> docs[Runbook]

  style worker fill:lightyellow,stroke:#ca8a04,font-style:italic
  linkStyle 0 stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:3px
  linkStyle 2 stroke:#ea580c,stroke-dasharray:2 4
  click docs "https://github.com/chamika/mermaid-archify" "Open the runbook"
  click api href "javascript:alert(1)" "Handles checkout orders"
